#! thorn palisade - cut thornbrush lashed between stakes, taller than a man
#! Stakes are solid body. Highlight catches only the upper third of each, where
#! light would actually reach over the thorns - running it the full height turns
#! three stakes into three bright rules and spends the whole highlight budget on
#! them. Thorns are stipple spurring off the stakes, kept translucent so the
#! tangle never out-masses what holds it up. Uneven tops: nobody measured them.
